  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support HDF Grootvlei follow-up</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To be able to establish a Horti Demo Facility (GHEF) to create alternative jobs and business opportunities and healthy food for the local communities of the Grootvlei coal-fired powerplant, development of a business case for a South African-Dutch consortium, coordination and tailor-made advise to pave the way for the implementation of facility are needed.The implementation of the GHEF is an important step in the further development of the Grootvlei combi-track, including the development of a future agro hub in the area.During the former project, a core group has been formed and a management structure around the initiation of the agro hub has been completed.With this project, Seed2Feed continues this work, provides extra support for the GHEF construction and supports with technical issues.</narrative>
  </description>
